- How would you test the registry and pipeline separately?
- How would you version validators and roll back if a validator changes semantics?

## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design extensible runtime components with clear interfaces, dynamic loading, and observable metrics, all critical for gateway resilience at scale.

## Key Concepts

